  "body": "This an exceptional Campbells Bay family home, with sweeping sea views, all-day sun, resort-style outdoor living and Centennial Park directly over the back fence, this is a rare opportunity to secure an outstanding coastal lifestyle before summer arrives.\r\n\r\nSet across approximately 310sqm, the home has been designed with family life in mind. Five generous bedrooms, multiple living areas and excellent separation provide space for everyone-whether the children need a zone of their own, guests are staying or you simply want room to spread out.\r\n\r\nNorth-facing living areas are filled with natural light and flow effortlessly to the outdoor entertaining zone. Here, the pool, spa and built-in bar create the perfect setting for long summer afternoons, relaxed evenings and memorable celebrations with family and friends.\r\n\r\nBeyond the back fence, Centennial Park provides a beautiful green backdrop and a rare sense of privacy and tranquillity. Combined with the elevated sea views and spectacular sunsets, it is an outlook that changes throughout the day and never gets old.\r\n\r\nWHY YOU'LL LOVE IT:\r\n\r\n* Five generous bedrooms and two bathrooms\r\n* Approximately 310sqm of contemporary family living\r\n* Substantial 1,017sqm freehold section\r\n* Multiple living areas with excellent family separation\r\n* Pool, spa and dedicated entertaining area with built-in bar\r\n* North-facing for all-day sun\r\n* Sweeping sea views and spectacular sunsets\r\n* Centennial Park directly over the back fence\r\n* Leafy outlook towards Pupuke Golf Club\r\n* Double garaging with internal access\r\n* Tightly held Campbells Bay location\r\n\r\nThe lifestyle is every bit as impressive as the home. Walk to Campbells Bay School, wander down to Campbells Bay Beach and reach the motorway within minutes.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate the exceptional school zones, including Campbells Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Wairau Intermediate, Westlake Boys High School and Westlake Girls High School.\r\n\r\nSea views, sunshine, genuine family separation and resort-style entertaining-all within one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal communities.\r\n\r\nThe deadline is set. Conditional and unconditional interest is welcome, so make sure this one is on your viewing list.\r\n\r\nContact Harrison Cutfield or Drew Miller to arrange your viewing today!",
